  "honest_assessment": "World-class engineering capabilities but primarily a project company, not a catalog product supplier. B2B procurement from L&T works best for custom-engineered equipment (heat exchangers, pressure vessels, turbines). Minimum project values typically start at ₹1 crore. Their procurement process is bureaucratic - expect 4-6 weeks just for technical evaluation. Quality is unquestionable but timelines often slip 10-20%. Best suited for infrastructure and heavy industry buyers."
